## Reproduce or verify

Requires Node.js 20+, Python 3.9+, and FFmpeg/ffprobe on PATH:

```sh
node scripts/download-music-assets.mjs
python scripts/catalog-music-assets.py
```

The downloader resumes files whose hashes match the saved download records.
The second command works offline, verifies and decodes all music, checks loop
bounds and result cue references, and rebuilds the catalog and sampler.
